<template name="tus_settings_randomization_Monomachine">
<head>
</head>
<body>
	<div class="settings-page">
		<h1>Random Trigs</h1>
		<settingsspacer1/>
		<label>Chance that each step receives a trig when a random-trig chord fires (FUNCTION + DOWN for the selected track, BANK + ARP or BANK + SLIDE for every track). New trigs get random notes, in the chosen scale when one is set. Double-click the slider to reset to 50 %. Saved with the plugin state, per instance.</label>
		<settingsspacer1/>
		<div class="settings-hlayout">
			<input id="sliderTrigChance" class="settings-slider-h" type="range" min="1" max="99" step="1" value="50" style="width: 90%;"/>
			<label id="labelTrigChance">50 %</label>
		</div>
		<settingsspacer1/>
		<h1>Random Parameter Locks</h1>
		<settingsspacer1/>
		<label>Chance that each trig receives a lock on a parameter picked for randomization. Applies to every lock chord: the current page, a single parameter, all tracks, and the everything chord. Double-click to reset to 50 %.</label>
		<settingsspacer1/>
		<div class="settings-hlayout">
			<input id="sliderLockChance" class="settings-slider-h" type="range" min="1" max="99" step="1" value="50" style="width: 90%;"/>
			<label id="labelLockChance">50 %</label>
		</div>
		<settingsspacer1/>
		<h1>Include Tracks</h1>
		<settingsspacer1/>
		<label>Untick a track to leave it out of the randomize gestures: its trigs, its machine, or its parameter locks. All tracks are included by default. Saved with the plugin state, so it travels with your DAW project.</label>
		<settingsspacer1/>
		<table class="settings-table">
			<tr class="settings-tr">
				<td class="settings-td"><label>Track 1</label></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exTrig0" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Trigs</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exMach0" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Machine</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exLock0" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Locks</label></div></td>
			</tr>
			<tr class="settings-tr">
				<td class="settings-td"><label>Track 2</label></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exTrig1" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Trigs</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exMach1" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Machine</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exLock1" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Locks</label></div></td>
			</tr>
			<tr class="settings-tr">
				<td class="settings-td"><label>Track 3</label></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exTrig2" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Trigs</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exMach2" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Machine</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exLock2" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Locks</label></div></td>
			</tr>
			<tr class="settings-tr">
				<td class="settings-td"><label>Track 4</label></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exTrig3" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Trigs</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exMach3" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Machine</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exLock3" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Locks</label></div></td>
			</tr>
			<tr class="settings-tr">
				<td class="settings-td"><label>Track 5</label></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exTrig4" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Trigs</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exMach4" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Machine</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exLock4" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Locks</label></div></td>
			</tr>
			<tr class="settings-tr">
				<td class="settings-td"><label>Track 6</label></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exTrig5" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Trigs</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exMach5" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Machine</label></div></td>
				<td class="settings-td"><div id="exLock5" class="settings-checkboxwithlabel"><button id="button" class="settings-checkbox"/><label>Locks</label></div></td>
			</tr>
		</table>
		<settingsspacer1/>
	</div>
</body>
</template>
